* <Natural Source Header
* Copycode  C-COMMI2 (copied from C-COMMIT)
* Version   3.5
* Function  INVOKED WHENEVER AN UPDATE IS DONE TO DB
*
*
* Maintenance
* -----------
* uuuuuu  yyyy-mm-dd iTrac       Remark
* SU      2017-08-01             NOM3.5 created
************************************************************************
*
IF G-AUTOCOMMIT = 'I'
  END TRANSACTION
  RESET G-COMMIT G-HOLD-TIME
  #ESC-COMMIT := TRUE
ELSE
  G-COMMIT := TRUE
END-IF
** End of Copycode C-COMMI2 ********************************************
